{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/\uc601\uc5b4_en_us__1.png?t=1749902895\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/steam4.gif?t=1749902895\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One or two creatures might be manageable, but the horde is relentless. Each creature follows a unique playbook, with mechanics often conflicting one another. Eliminate them strategically, or be swallowed by the panic-induced chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/\uc601\uc5b4_en_us__2.png?t=1749902895\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/steam2.gif?t=1749902895\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture into the darkness with a team of up to four. Work together to overcome the terror\u2026 or don't. You can also use a variety of items to scare your teammates! don't worry. A little revival ritual might just bring them back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/\uc601\uc5b4__en_us__3.png?t=1749902895\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/steam3.gif?t=1749902895\" /></div>The horrors of Happy Door don't manifest in ordinary ways. An unnatural humming, the trembling of nearby objects\u2014these are your only warnings as entities spawn. Rally your team and unleash light upon them to halt the summoning! Your staff isn't just a simple lamp\u2014it's your only defense for keeping the horror at bay.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3786990?t=1749902895","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/2dcd51fc21dc68760ee0bd58de478a8882c8be3e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749902895","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/f37c44ff2c6a020bcb5f86f62b5223308c768504/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749902895","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/f37c44ff2c6a020bcb5f86f62b5223308c768504/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749902895","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":51},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/\uc601\uc5b4_en_us__1.png?t=1749902895\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/steam4.gif?t=1749902895\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One or two creatures might be manageable, but the horde is relentless. Each creature follows a unique playbook, with mechanics often conflicting one another. Eliminate them strategically, or be swallowed by the panic-induced chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/\uc601\uc5b4_en_us__2.png?t=1749902895\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/steam2.gif?t=1749902895\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture into the darkness with a team of up to four. Work together to overcome the terror\u2026 or don't. You can also use a variety of items to scare your teammates! don't worry. A little revival ritual might just bring them back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/\uc601\uc5b4__en_us__3.png?t=1749902895\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/steam3.gif?t=1749902895\" /></div>The horrors of Happy Door don't manifest in ordinary ways. An unnatural humming, the trembling of nearby objects\u2014these are your only warnings as entities spawn. Rally your team and unleash light upon them to halt the summoning! Your staff isn't just a simple lamp\u2014it's your only defense for keeping the horror at bay.</p>","developers":["Dopamine Maker"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/2c347d85b5fd66e8e01450f94c5bdfc8e41cc7de/header.jpg?t=1749902895","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul cla